      "content": "You are an expert JavaScript programmer. Write a single JavaScript function that implements Conway's Game of Life with advanced features.\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n- Function takes a canvas ID parameter (canvas will be 500x500px)\n- Renders Conway's Game of Life on the provided canvas\n- Uses emojis to represent cells with different emojis for different generations\n- Includes famous patterns: Glider, Blinker, Gosper Gun, Pulsar (selectable via dropdown)\n- Speed control slider (1-10 generations per second)\n- Click-to-toggle cells for custom patterns\n- \"Randomize\" and \"Clear\" buttons\n- Aging system where cells change emojis based on survival time\n- Death animation with fade-out effect\n- Smooth 60 FPS performance\n- No external libraries, works in all major browsers\n\nOUTPUT: Valid JavaScript code only. No explanatory text, comments outside code, or markdown formatting."
